ended":false,"hp":9886.448,"atk":346.2464,"def":1000.368},{"level":77,"ascended":false,"hp":9964.6784,"atk":348.9408,"def":1008.2784},{"level":78,"ascended":false,"hp":10042.816,"atk":351.6384,"def":1016.1888},{"level":79,"ascended":false,"hp":10121.0464,"atk":354.336,"def":1024.0992},{"level":80,"ascended":false,"hp":10199.2768,"atk":357.0336,"def":1032.0096},{"level":80,"ascended":true,"hp":10817.9744,"atk":373.0336,"def":1094.2272},{"level":81,"ascended":false,"hp":10896.112,"atk":375.728,"def":1102.1376},{"level":82,"ascended":false,"hp":10974.3424,"atk":378.4256,"def":1110.048},{"level":83,"ascended":false,"hp":11052.5728,"atk":381.1232,"def":1117.9584},{"level":84,"ascended":false,"hp":11130.7104,"atk":383.8176,"def":1125.8688},{"level":85,"ascended":false,"hp":11208.9408,"atk":386.5152,"def":1133.7792},{"level":86,"ascended":false,"hp":11287.1712,"atk":389.2128,"def":1141.6896},{"level":87,"ascended":false,"hp":11365.3088,"atk":391.9072,"def":1149.6},{"level":88,"ascended":false,"hp":11443.5392,"atk":394.6048,"def":1157.5104},{"level":89,"ascended":false,"hp":11521.7696,"atk":397.3024,"def":1165.4208},{"level":90,"ascended":false,"hp":11600,"atk":400,"def":1173.3312}],"baseCritRate":0.05,"baseCritDmg":1.5,"traceNodes":[{"id":808,"stat":"critRate","value":0.012,"label":"Crit. Rate increased by 1.20%."},{"id":809,"stat":"atkPct","value":0.018,"label":"ATK increased by 1.80%."},{"id":810,"stat":"atkPct","value":0.018,"label":"ATK increased by 1.80%."},{"id":811,"stat":"critRate","value":0.012,"label":"Crit. Rate increased by 1.20%."},{"id":812,"stat":"critRate","value":0.028,"label":"Crit. Rate increased by 2.80%."},{"id":813,"stat":"atkPct","value":0.042,"label":"ATK increased by 4.20%."},{"id":814,"stat":"atkPct","value":0.042,"label":"ATK increased by 4.20%."},{"id":815,"stat":"critRate","value":0.028,"label":"Crit. Rate increased by 2.80%."}],"skills":[{"id":1004801,"type":"normal","name":"Mix-'n'-Match","description":"Basic Attack - Huntress\n\nPerform up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nHeavy Attack - Huntress\n\nHold Normal Attack to continuously fire at enemies at the cost of STA, dealing Electro DMG, considered Basic Attack DMG.\n- Hold and then release Normal Attack while Rebecca is not casting Tactical Dodge - Huntress to cast Heavy Attack - Eat Lead!: Huntress\n\nHeavy Attack - Eat Lead!: Huntress\n\nDeal Electro DMG.\n\nComin' in Hot! - Huntress\n\nSomersault in mid-air and land.\nKeep holding Normal Attack after casting this skill to follow up with Heavy Attack - Huntress without consuming STA.\n\nMid-air Plunging Attack - Huntress\n\nConsume STA to perform a Plunging Attack, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nDodge Counter - Huntress\n\nPress Normal Attack shortly after a successful Dodge to strike the target, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nTactical Dodge - Huntress\n\nPress Dodge to attack the target while dodging, dealing Electro DMG.\nCan be cast during the following actions (while on the ground):\n- Performing Basic Attack - Huntress.\n- Performing Heavy Attack - Huntress.\n- Performing Heavy Attack - Eat Lead!: Huntress\n- Casting Comin' in Hot! - Huntress.\n- Casting Tactical Dodge - Huntress.\n- Casting Resonance Skill.\n- Casting Intro Skill.\nAdditional Electro DMG is dealt upon a successful Dodge during Tactical Dodge - Huntress.\nKeep holding Normal Attack after casting this skill to follow up with Heavy Attack - Huntress without consuming STA.\n\nBasic Attack - Guts\n\nPerform up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing Electro DMG.\nCasting Tactical Dodge - Guts does not reset Basic Attack - Huntress's attack cycle within a certain time.\n\nHeavy Attack - Guts\n\nConsume STA and attack the target, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nMid-air Plunging Attack - Guts\n\nConsume STA to perform a Plunging Attack, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nDodge Counter - Guts\n\nPress Normal Attack shortly after a successful Dodge to strike the target, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nTactical Dodge - Guts\n\nPress Dodge and attack the target while dodging, dealing Electro DMG.\nCan be cast during the following actions (while on the ground):\n- Performing Basic Attack - Guts.\n- Casting Tactical Dodge - Guts.\n- Casting Resonance Skill.\n- Casting Intro Skill.\nAdditional Electro DMG is dealt upon a successful Dodge during Tactical Dodge - Guts.","actionIds":[1411001,1411002,1411003,1411004,1411005,1411006,1411007,1411008,1411009,1411010,1411011,1411012,1411013,1411014,1411015,1411016,1411097]},{"id":1004802,"type":"skill","name":"Tactical Tweaks","description":"Resonance Skill - It's Big Boomin' Time!\n\nPress Resonance Skill when in the Huntress mode to close the distance and spray lead at enemies, then switch to the Guts mode to blast the target, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nResonance Skill - Come 'n' Get Me!\n\nPress Resonance Skill when in the Guts mode to spray lead at the enemy, then use recoil from shooting the ground to close the distance and switch to Huntress mode to continue the barrage, dealing Electro DMG.\nPress or hold Normal Attack when close to the ground shortly after casting this skill to follow up with Comin' in Hot! - Huntress.","actionIds":[1411022,1411023]},{"id":1004803,"type":"liberation","name":"Party 'til Dawn!","description":"Switching to Mk. 31 HMG mode generates a field of Stagnation for 9.5s, in which:\nRebecca fires the Mk. 31 HMG automatically, dealing Electro DMG, considered Basic Attack DMG, while accumulating Overload. Press or hold Normal Attack or press Resonance Liberation at intervals after Rebecca starts firing to enhance her Mk. 31 HMG's firepower and accumulate Overload faster. This effect can be triggered up to 2 times.\n- The machine gun will only auto-lock onto the enemy closest to the crosshair in the aim down sight.\n- Rebecca is immobile when firing the Mk. 31 HMG and gains 50% DMG Reduction and Immunity to Interrruption.\n\nOverload\n\nRebecca can hold up to 90 points of Overload.\nHitting targets with the standard firepower Mk. 31 HMG grants 2 points.\nHitting targets with the enhanced firepower Mk. 31 HMG grants 4 points.\nHitting targets with the twice-enhanced firepower Mk. 31 HMG grants 6 points.\n\nBOOM! Fireworks!\n\nAfter Mk. 31 HMG mode ends or when Overload is maxed, BOOM! Fireworks! is automatically cast, dealing Electro DMG. Casting BOOM! Fireworks! ends  Mk. 31 HMG.\n- Hold Resonance Liberation while in Mk. 31 HMG mode to immediatly cast BOOM! Fireworks!.\n- Leaving the Mk. 31 HMG mode removes all Overload.","actionIds":[1411028,1411029,1411030,1411031]},{"id":1004804,"type":"inherent","name":"Tag, You're It!","description":"ATK is increased by 10% for 12s when A Girl Gets What She Wants! is triggered, or when Heavy Attack - Rat-tat-tat!: Huntress or Heavy Attack - Bang-bang-bang!: Guts is cast, stacking up to 2 times.\nWhen a Resonator in the team inflicts Hack - Shifting, their Tune Break Boost is increased by 30 for 30s.","actionIds":[]},{"id":1004805,"type":"inherent","name":"Left an Opening!","description":"Heavy Attack - Rat-tat-tat!: Huntress and Heavy Attack - Bang-bang-bang!: Guts gain increased resistance to interruption.\nWhen Rebecca casts Resonance Liberation - Party 'til Dawn!, the ATK of all nearby Resonators in the team is increased by 20% for 30s.","actionIds":[]},{"id":1004806,"type":"intro","name":"My Turn!","description":"Yo, It's Big Boomin' Time!\n\nWhen in the Huntress mode, upon casting Intro Skill, Rebecca approaches the enemy and sprays lead with Huntress, then switches to the Guts mode to blast the target, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nHey, Leadhead, Come 'n' Get Me!\n\nWhen in the Guts mode, upon casting Intro Skill, Rebecca approaches the enemy using the recoil of Guts from shooting the ground and switches to the Huntress mode to spray lead at the enemy, dealing Electro DMG.\nPress or hold Normal Attack when close to the ground shortly after casting this skill to follow up with Comin' in Hot! - Huntress.","actionIds":[1411035,1411036]},{"id":1004807,"type":"forte","name":"Gloves Are Comin' Off!","description":"Switch Gears!\n\nUpon casting Resonance Skill or Intro Skill, Rebecca can freely switch between the Huntress and Guts modes.\n- The Huntress mode increases Rebecca's Crit. DMG by 30%.\n- The Guts mode allows Rebecca to ignore 15% of the target's DEF.\nBy default, Rebecca starts in the Huntress mode.\n\nHack - Shifting\n\nRebecca inflicts Hack - Shifting upon dealing damage to the targets through the following skills. The same skill can trigger this effect once every 3s:\nIntro Skill - Yo, It's Big Boomin' Time!, Intro Skill - Hey, Leadhead, Come 'n' Get Me!, Heavy Attack - Rat-tat-tat!: Huntress, Heavy Attack - Bang-bang-bang!: Guts, and Resonance Liberation - BOOM! Fireworks!.\n\nHack Response - Meltdown\n\nDeal Electro DMG to all targets affected by Hack - Interfered within the range, considered Hack DMG.\n\nHeavy Attack - Rat-tat-tat!: Huntress\n\nAt 120 points of Fervor, Heavy Attack - Huntress is replaced with Heavy Attack - Rat-tat-tat!: Huntress. Hold Normal Attack to cast Heavy Attack - Rat-tat-tat!: Huntress, which consumes all Fervor to pull in nearby targets and deal Electro DMG, considered Basic Attack DMG.\nDuring Heavy Attack - Huntress, if Fervor is at 120 points and Rebecca is not in the action of Tactical Dodge - Huntress, release Normal Attack to cast Heavy Attack - Rat-tat-tat!: Huntress.\n\nHeavy Attack - Bang-bang-bang!: Guts\n\nAt 120 points of Fervor, Heavy Attack - Guts is replaced with Heavy Attack - Bang-bang-bang!: Guts. Hold Normal Attack  to cast Heavy Attack - Bang-bang-bang!: Guts, which consumes all Fervor to pull in nearby targets and deal Electro DMG, considered Basic Attack DMG.\n\nFervor\n\nRebecca can hold up to 120 points of Fervor.\nNormal Attacks restore Fervor upon damaging the target.\nResonance Skill restores Fervor upon damaging the target.\nWhen A Girl Gets What She Wants! is gained by casting Intro Skill - Yo, It's Big Boomin' Time! or Intro Skill - Hey, Leadhead, Come 'n' Get Me!, Rebecca restores 50 points of Fervor.\n\nHot Hand\n\nRebecca can hold up to 120 points of Hot Hand.\nRegenerates over time at a rate of 10 points per second.\nCasting Heavy Attack - Rat-tat-tat!: Huntress or Heavy Attack - Bang-bang-bang!: Guts restores 40 {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=A}.\n\nA Girl Gets What She Wants!\n\nAt 120 points of Hot Hand, casting Intro Skill - Yo, It's Big Boomin' Time!, Intro Skill - Hey, Leadhead, Come 'n' Get Me!, Resonance Skill -  It's Big Boomin' Time!, or Resonance Skill - Come 'n' Get Me! grants the following effects for 12s:\nRebecca simultaneously gains the Stat Bonuses of both the Huntress and Guts modes, regardless of which mode she's currently in.\nHot Hand cannot be restored during this period and is consumed by 10 {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=B} per second.","actionIds":[1411026,1411027,1411098]},{"id":1004808,"type":"inherent","name":"Skillful Cooking","description":"Has a chance to produce special dishes when cooking.","actionIds":[]},{"id":1004809,"type":"outro","name":"Preem Choom","description":"Summon a turret that continuously attacks enemies for 14s, dealing 2.5% Electro DMG each hit.\nThe incoming Resonator gains Edgerunner Bonds, granting 15% All DMG Amplification for 14s. Resonators with Edgerunner Bonds gain 1 stacks of Overlimit every 0.2s, each stack granting 0.5% Heavy Attack DMG Amplification, up to 35% (Lucy automatically receives max stacks when her Edgerunner Bonds is active). Switching to another Resonator ends Edgerunner Bonds and Overlimit early.\nLucy can enhance the turret, increasing its DMG Multiplier by 250%, but its on-field duration will be lowered to 4s.","actionIds":[]},{"id":1004810,"type":"tuneBreak","name":"Hack - Meltdown","description":"When the target's Off-Tune Level is full, Rebecca can cast Tune Break on the target.\n\nRebecca can inflict Hack - Shifting and respond to Hack - Interfered on targets.\nResponding to Hack - Interfered:  When any Resonator in the team deals Tune Break DMG and inflic